{"unit_id": "RestRegular__dsh-computer-use#feature-1", "repo": "RestRegular/dsh-computer-use", "commit": "fc29479e473dbbe1a25f85f9068f07df316f05f2", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**DSH Computer Use** 的功能「桌面截图」：computer_screenshot 可截取整个桌面、显示器、指定窗口或矩形区域，并返回图像及坐标元数据；可设置 PNG/JPEG、是否包含光标和最长边。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:173-216", "lib/screenshot.js:35-100"]}
{"unit_id": "RestRegular__dsh-computer-use#feature-2", "repo": "RestRegular/dsh-computer-use", "commit": "fc29479e473dbbe1a25f85f9068f07df316f05f2", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**DSH Computer Use** 的功能「鼠标键盘和剪贴板」：computer_action 执行移动、点击、拖动、滚动、按键、快捷键、输入文字、等待及剪贴板读写；坐标默认对应最近截图的图像像素。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:219-230", "lib/tools.js:250-310"]}
{"unit_id": "RestRegular__dsh-computer-use#feature-3", "repo": "RestRegular/dsh-computer-use", "commit": "fc29479e473dbbe1a25f85f9068f07df316f05f2", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**DSH Computer Use** 的功能「窗口管理」：computer_windows 列出顶层窗口及其标题、进程、边界和状态，并支持聚焦或更改窗口状态。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/tools.js:387-438"]}
{"unit_id": "RestRegular__dsh-computer-use#feature-4", "repo": "RestRegular/dsh-computer-use", "commit": "fc29479e473dbbe1a25f85f9068f07df316f05f2", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**DSH Computer Use** 的功能「坐标映射」：使用截图坐标操作时，插件根据最近截图记录的图像尺寸和桌面捕获矩形换算屏幕坐标；也可明确指定 screen 坐标。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/coordinates.js:20-56", "lib/screenshot.js:74-100"]}
{"unit_id": "RestRegular__dsh-computer-use#feature-5", "repo": "RestRegular/dsh-computer-use", "commit": "fc29479e473dbbe1a25f85f9068f07df316f05f2", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**DSH Computer Use** 的功能「人工批准与接管」：输入操作可先请求人工批准，随后由 helper 接管屏幕；用户可通过蒙版聊天面板发送消息或取消接管，亦可用紧急热键结束操作。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/approval.js:25-68"]}
